---
<GuidePage path={path} title="OpenAI Agent Builder Alternatives: Shuts Down Nov 30, 2026 | Swarmnest" description="OpenAI Agent Builder shuts down Nov 30, 2026. How to export workflows to the Agents SDK, and the best visual builders and frameworks to move to." faqs={faqs} sources={sources}>
<p class="lead">OpenAI is retiring Agent Builder, the visual canvas from AgentKit. Here is what changes, how to get your workflows out, and where to rebuild them, checked against OpenAI's docs on Oct 29, 2026.</p>
<div class="notice"><strong>Key Date: Nov 30, 2026.</strong> OpenAI says Agent Builder is scheduled to shut down on November 30, 2026, along with OpenAI Evals. ChatKit stays available.</div>
<h2 id="how-to-migrate">How to Migrate</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>List your workflows.</strong> Note each workflow's tools, connectors, guardrails and where it is embedded with ChatKit.</li>
<li><strong>Export each one as code.</strong> In Agent Builder, use Code to export the workflow as Agents SDK code in Python or TypeScript.</li>
<li><strong>Choose where it runs.</strong> Keep it as code in your own app with the Agents SDK, rebuild it as a ChatGPT Workspace Agent for internal teams, or rebuild it on another platform below.</li>
<li><strong>Test before you switch.</strong> OpenAI says the export does not convert the graph or guarantee identical behavior. Check control flow, tool calls, sign-in and permissions with real inputs.</li>
<li><strong>Move your chat UI.</strong> If you used ChatKit with a hosted workflow, point ChatKit at your own server-side agent.</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="openai-paths">OpenAI's Own Replacement Paths</h2>
<CmpTable cols={['Type','Open Source','Self-Host','Good For']} rows={openai} />
<h2 id="visual">Visual Agent Builder Alternatives</h2>
<CmpTable cols={['Type','Open Source','Self-Host','Good For']} rows={visual} />
<h2 id="code">Code-First Alternatives</h2>
<CmpTable cols={['Type','Open Source','Self-Host','Good For']} rows={code} />
<p>Compare frameworks in <a href="/guides/crewai-vs-langgraph-vs-autogen/">CrewAI vs LangGraph vs AutoGen</a>, or browse every <a href="/directory/visual-agent-builders/">Visual Agent Builder</a> and <a href="/directory/agent-frameworks/">Agent Framework</a> in the directory.</p>
</GuidePage>
